<title>CHINA: China January cotton imports up 119.7 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>China January cotton imports up 119.7 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>China imported 90,000 tonnes of cotton in January 1997, up by 119.7 percent compared with January 1996, customs figures showed on Tuesday.</p>
<p>China's cotton imports reached 650,000 tonnes in 1996, down by 12.2 percent compared with 1995.</p>
<p>Cotton exports in January were zero, compared with 470 tonnes in January last year.</p>
<p>China's cotton exports in 1996 fell 79.2 percent to 4,493 tonnes from 21,619 tonnes in 1995.</p>
<p>-- Beijing Newsroom (8610) 6532 1921</p>
</text>
